WEBVTT

00:00:02.880 --> 00:00:05.430
Haru. Wake up, Haru.

00:00:06.340 --> 00:00:07.860
Ren? What's wrong?

00:00:08.530 --> 00:00:09.730
It's an emergency.

00:00:09.990 --> 00:00:11.610
What's the emergency?

00:00:13.420 --> 00:00:15.160
Something weird grew on my chest.

00:00:22.550 --> 00:00:23.530
A dream?

00:00:25.420 --> 00:00:28.760
<i>Haruko-san, Dad, Mom...</i>

00:00:29.590 --> 00:00:33.010
<i>I'm a terrible adult.</i>

00:02:04.670 --> 00:02:07.180
Haru-san, good morning!

00:02:07.440 --> 00:02:10.300
It's raining again.

00:02:10.300 --> 00:02:13.470
We might not get many customers today.

00:02:13.470 --> 00:02:14.480
Ikuyoshi.

00:02:16.370 --> 00:02:18.300
Good morning, Iku.

00:02:18.300 --> 00:02:21.510
What the hell was that thing 
you gave me yesterday?

00:02:21.510 --> 00:02:24.260
Oh... I looked everywhere for that.

00:02:24.260 --> 00:02:28.210
I know your birthday is next month, 
but it's your present. How'd you like it?

00:02:29.670 --> 00:02:33.080
How dare you ask me that? I can't 
have decent dreams because of you!

00:02:33.080 --> 00:02:36.260
I feel awful this morning 
because of you, damn it!

00:02:36.260 --> 00:02:38.920
What? But I looked so hard for it.

00:02:38.920 --> 00:02:41.590
You should put that effort toward your job!

00:02:41.590 --> 00:02:45.810
Slim, short hair, uniform, 
cat-like eyes, baby face...

00:02:46.890 --> 00:02:50.680
My, doesn't this girl look like 
somebody's youngest brother?

00:02:51.060 --> 00:02:55.070
Uniform Girl

00:02:51.060 --> 00:02:55.070
Let's conduct 
a physical exam 
together

00:02:51.330 --> 00:02:55.070
What should I do with this DVD?

00:02:55.580 --> 00:02:59.320
I'm sorry. Please give that back.

00:02:59.320 --> 00:03:00.530
You're disgusting.

00:03:00.800 --> 00:03:04.650
Don't leave this in the café's back room.

00:03:04.650 --> 00:03:06.400
You have no tact.

00:03:06.640 --> 00:03:09.810
But I can't bring it into my home!

00:03:09.810 --> 00:03:11.790
What if Ren finds it?

00:03:14.360 --> 00:03:15.930
What about me?

00:03:16.880 --> 00:03:18.370
Ren?! Huh?

00:03:18.970 --> 00:03:20.420
Don't you have school today?

00:03:20.800 --> 00:03:22.190
It's Saturday.

00:03:22.190 --> 00:03:27.040
You told me to help hand-pick 
coffee beans so you could roast them.

00:03:27.040 --> 00:03:29.200
Oh, right, right!

00:03:29.200 --> 00:03:32.550
Give me a minute, Ren. I'll go get them.

00:03:35.020 --> 00:03:37.570
Well, with a child like this around,

00:03:37.940 --> 00:03:41.460
I guess he can't watch DVDs like 
that whenever he pleases.

00:03:42.360 --> 00:03:44.430
Kiyoka, you're here?

00:03:44.430 --> 00:03:48.330
That's what I hate about you! 
You're not cute at all!

00:03:48.850 --> 00:03:53.770
I do come here just to
 check on things sometimes.

00:03:53.770 --> 00:03:55.830
It hasn't been long since the café opened.

00:04:01.190 --> 00:04:04.430
Ren, sorry. These are the beans, but...

00:04:07.430 --> 00:04:10.380
Kiyo, damn you! What are you doing to my Ren?!

00:04:10.380 --> 00:04:15.190
Oh, I was just showing him 
how to massage his chest.

00:04:15.480 --> 00:04:18.190
Don't you prefer well-shaped 
breasts over large ones?

00:04:18.350 --> 00:04:21.190
Wait, Ren's a guy! That doesn't matter!

00:04:21.190 --> 00:04:23.620
Sure it does. It'll make him more sensitive.

00:04:23.620 --> 00:04:26.600
Or would you rather do it for him, Haru?

00:04:26.600 --> 00:04:28.370
In that case, I'll—

00:04:30.100 --> 00:04:33.210
<i>What an entertaining couple of brothers.</i>

00:04:33.210 --> 00:04:36.380
Ren! I've told you not to hit my face!

00:04:34.260 --> 00:04:37.230
Iku, could you make some coffee?

00:04:36.380 --> 00:04:37.830
Shut up, you pervert!

00:04:37.230 --> 00:04:42.370
Kiyoka-san, please stop 
making passes at Ren Ren.

00:04:42.370 --> 00:04:44.450
But it's so much fun.

00:04:58.500 --> 00:05:00.940
Exhausted

00:05:01.320 --> 00:05:05.960
What's wrong, Ren? It's only Monday 
morning, and you look like hell.

00:05:05.960 --> 00:05:07.450
I'm hot and tired.

00:05:08.340 --> 00:05:12.450
It's been raining since last week. 
And why is it so humid?

00:05:13.100 --> 00:05:15.840
It can't be helped. <i>Tsuyu</i> has started.

00:05:15.840 --> 00:05:16.460
<i>Tsuyu</i>?

00:05:17.010 --> 00:05:19.960
In Japan, the weather's like this 
for about a month this time of year.

00:05:20.280 --> 00:05:22.330
Oh, the rainy season.

00:05:22.330 --> 00:05:23.460
That's the one.

00:05:23.990 --> 00:05:27.970
Since it keeps raining lately, 
I haven't gone running in the mornings.

00:05:27.970 --> 00:05:31.830
You live a pretty healthy lifestyle. 
Is it to walk your dog?

00:05:31.830 --> 00:05:34.560
There's that, too, but this is different.

00:05:34.560 --> 00:05:36.850
Tanuki isn't strong enough.

00:05:36.850 --> 00:05:38.940
Just how much do you run?

00:05:39.460 --> 00:05:42.730
Not that far. Only about 20 kilometers.

00:05:43.180 --> 00:05:45.440
That's like a large-breed dog...

00:05:45.440 --> 00:05:50.220
Don't underestimate the strength of modern-day 
Japanese students. We're like old people.

00:05:50.220 --> 00:05:52.010
I know that.

00:05:52.010 --> 00:05:55.850
A lot of students don't even 
move while they're on the train.

00:05:57.510 --> 00:05:59.750
Wh-What's wrong with you?!

00:06:00.500 --> 00:06:04.150
Huh? I don't understand your question.

00:06:04.150 --> 00:06:07.010
Aw, jeez! I'm taking you to the nurse's office!

00:06:07.320 --> 00:06:08.630
A nosebleed?

00:06:09.150 --> 00:06:12.140
Just stick some tissue in there.

00:06:12.500 --> 00:06:15.140
Um, where's the school nurse?

00:06:15.320 --> 00:06:18.140
That's me. You got a problem with that?

00:06:18.370 --> 00:06:19.630
No way!

00:06:20.420 --> 00:06:22.900
<i>I was kind of looking forward to it...</i>

00:06:23.160 --> 00:06:25.440
<i>"Oh, my. What's wrong?"</i>

00:06:25.440 --> 00:06:27.290
<i>"You'll be okay."</i>

00:06:28.210 --> 00:06:29.660
But you're a dude!

00:06:29.660 --> 00:06:32.920
You moron. No one would hire a young

00:06:32.920 --> 00:06:36.660
and beautiful nurse to look 
after you sordid wolves.

00:06:37.150 --> 00:06:40.690
If you want to skip class to take a nap, 
write your name down there.

00:06:40.690 --> 00:06:43.110
I'll inform your homeroom teacher later.

00:06:43.110 --> 00:06:45.940
Yeah, yeah. All we've got is PE, anyway.

00:06:45.940 --> 00:06:47.670
I'll skip class with you.

00:06:49.660 --> 00:06:50.630
Kaidou?

00:06:50.960 --> 00:06:53.170
You're Kaidou Ren?

00:06:54.140 --> 00:06:55.140
What about it?

00:06:55.370 --> 00:07:00.100
People were talking about you in the faculty 
office after the entrance ceremony.

00:07:00.100 --> 00:07:02.190
The scholarship student returning from abroad.

00:07:02.770 --> 00:07:05.320
There are other scholarship students,

00:07:05.320 --> 00:07:07.630
and these days it's not unusual 
for kids to spend time abroad.

00:07:07.630 --> 00:07:10.980
You've got it all wrong! 
I said after the entrance ceremony!

00:07:12.470 --> 00:07:14.510
The parents and guardians were making a fuss

00:07:14.510 --> 00:07:16.880
over a handsome man who 
looked like a foreign model.

00:07:16.880 --> 00:07:18.350
Because of him,

00:07:18.350 --> 00:07:22.510
the security guards and faculty had 
to be mobilized during the ceremony.

00:07:22.510 --> 00:07:27.740
And in the end, he nonchalantly walked off 
hand-in-hand with his little brother.

00:07:28.050 --> 00:07:32.790
Did you know people still pass 
around photos of your brother?

00:07:35.050 --> 00:07:36.470
Ren!

00:07:37.270 --> 00:07:41.100
Later, everyone seemed to accept the 
situation when they heard he was a host.

00:07:41.440 --> 00:07:44.440
With that face, he must be making a lot of money.

00:07:45.240 --> 00:07:49.460
He quit being a host. Now he's an 
ordinary food service worker.

00:07:49.460 --> 00:07:50.440
Oh?

00:07:50.920 --> 00:07:54.720
Come to think of it, I heard you 
lived in Canada until last year.

00:07:54.720 --> 00:07:58.950
Summers in Japan are pretty damn hot. 
Will you be able to handle it?

00:07:59.370 --> 00:08:00.950
But Japan is in a temperate zone.

00:08:00.950 --> 00:08:05.600
Unfortunately for you, 
Tokyo in summer is like a jungle.

00:08:05.600 --> 00:08:08.460
You don't want to start 
getting nosebleeds at this point.

00:08:10.850 --> 00:08:13.030
Or are you just backed up?

00:08:13.030 --> 00:08:15.720
You should take care of yourself once in a while.

00:08:16.370 --> 00:08:19.470
Huh? Backed up? Take care of myself?

00:08:21.100 --> 00:08:23.480
What are you saying, you geezer?!

00:08:23.480 --> 00:08:26.150
That's sexual harassment! 
Think about who you're talking to!

00:08:26.150 --> 00:08:29.880
You idiot! I'm a doctor! 
That's a normal thing to say!

00:08:29.880 --> 00:08:33.980
Don't kids your age think about that all the time?

00:08:33.980 --> 00:08:36.470
Maybe I do, but Ren is different!

00:08:36.470 --> 00:08:38.290
Then you teach him!

00:08:38.290 --> 00:08:39.350
No way!

00:08:39.350 --> 00:08:40.170
What?!

00:08:40.170 --> 00:08:41.620
It stopped.

00:08:52.830 --> 00:08:53.710
It stopped?

00:08:54.450 --> 00:08:56.050
Hi, Natsu.

00:08:56.320 --> 00:08:57.090
Huh?!

00:08:58.550 --> 00:08:59.930
Long time, no see.

00:08:59.930 --> 00:09:01.100
<i>The Anzai sisters...</i>

00:09:01.700 --> 00:09:03.660
Wakana-san, Mimi-chan?

00:09:03.660 --> 00:09:06.270
Did I tell you about this place?

00:09:06.270 --> 00:09:07.880
We saw this.

00:09:07.880 --> 00:09:11.130
A new type of 
café & bar opens

00:09:08.130 --> 00:09:09.910
It was a coincidence.

00:09:09.910 --> 00:09:10.690
Huh?

00:09:11.320 --> 00:09:12.790
<i>That bastard...</i>

00:09:12.790 --> 00:09:16.750
We instantly recognized you and Iku-chan.

00:09:16.750 --> 00:09:21.120
But it's okay. We're the only 
regulars who have noticed so far.

00:09:21.470 --> 00:09:23.620
We won't tell the others.

00:09:23.620 --> 00:09:27.690
I'm glad you seem to be doing well. 
You look like you're busy, so we'll leave.

00:09:27.690 --> 00:09:29.690
What? You're not going to have tea?

00:09:29.690 --> 00:09:32.880
We skipped work to come here.

00:09:32.880 --> 00:09:36.550
Sorry for dropping by so suddenly. 
Next time, we'll come for lunch.

00:09:36.550 --> 00:09:37.380
Okay.

00:09:37.610 --> 00:09:40.070
It's so strange to think of you cooking.

00:09:40.070 --> 00:09:41.610
<i>Until recently,</i>

00:09:40.660 --> 00:09:43.530
We're looking forward to it, 
so keep up the good work.

00:09:42.720 --> 00:09:46.140
<i>this probably wasn't an uncommon sight.</i>

00:09:43.530 --> 00:09:44.720
Thanks.

00:09:46.720 --> 00:09:50.960
<i>I just hadn't had the opportunity 
to see it before.</i>

00:09:56.570 --> 00:09:59.110
Ren... Hey, Ren!

00:09:59.560 --> 00:10:00.330
Ren!

00:10:00.330 --> 00:10:01.740
Shut up. What do you want?

00:10:01.740 --> 00:10:04.450
What do I want? You didn't 
respond when I called you...

00:10:09.940 --> 00:10:13.460
Ren, they're regulars from 
when I worked as a host.

00:10:13.820 --> 00:10:16.820
They just stopped by to see me today.

00:10:16.820 --> 00:10:21.100
Haru, what do you want me to say?

00:10:22.400 --> 00:10:23.350
Nothing, really.

00:10:23.720 --> 00:10:26.000
Just "I'm home."

00:10:28.520 --> 00:10:29.420
I'm home.

00:10:32.720 --> 00:10:33.680
Welcome back.

00:10:35.350 --> 00:10:38.110
You have nothing to worry about.

00:10:39.690 --> 00:10:40.610
I know.

00:10:44.000 --> 00:10:46.900
You're like a dog. How cute.

00:10:46.900 --> 00:10:47.620
Shut up.

00:10:51.310 --> 00:10:52.000
Ren?

00:10:52.440 --> 00:10:53.560
Hey, what's wrong?

00:10:53.560 --> 00:10:55.290
<i>What was that?</i>

00:10:56.110 --> 00:10:58.060
It's nothing.

00:10:58.900 --> 00:11:01.010
I remembered that I need to walk Tanuki.

00:11:01.010 --> 00:11:04.200
Oh, it has been raining a lot lately.

00:11:04.530 --> 00:11:07.020
We should get a raincoat for Tanuki.

00:11:07.670 --> 00:11:09.480
Right, Tanuki?

00:11:08.220 --> 00:11:11.020
<i>He just touched me like he always does.</i>

00:11:12.100 --> 00:11:15.890
<i>Something's wrong with my body...</i>

00:11:24.240 --> 00:11:25.330
It's raining again.

00:11:27.040 --> 00:11:28.950
I can't run today, either.

00:11:38.250 --> 00:11:39.150
Ren?

00:11:46.570 --> 00:11:47.470
Ren?

00:11:48.150 --> 00:11:49.980
Ren, are you okay?

00:11:50.900 --> 00:11:52.230
I'm fine.

00:11:54.980 --> 00:11:55.780
Haru!

00:11:56.480 --> 00:11:58.980
You idiot! That's cold water.

00:11:59.440 --> 00:12:00.930
You'll freeze.

00:12:00.930 --> 00:12:02.990
I don't care! Get out!

00:12:03.620 --> 00:12:07.880
Oh... Pouring water on it won't make it go away.

00:12:08.570 --> 00:12:11.250
Wh-When did you notice?

00:12:11.250 --> 00:12:14.290
Well, I'm a man, too.

00:12:14.820 --> 00:12:16.570
You'll catch a cold if you stay like that.

00:12:16.570 --> 00:12:18.750
Take care of it and come back to bed, okay?

00:12:19.950 --> 00:12:22.860
H-How...

00:12:24.390 --> 00:12:27.020
<i>Huh? Come to think of it,</i>

00:12:27.020 --> 00:12:29.390
<i>who taught me about this stuff?</i>

00:12:29.760 --> 00:12:34.400
<i>Around his age, kids just naturally 
start hearing all kinds of things,</i>

00:12:34.940 --> 00:12:39.770
<i>and sometimes it comes up when 
you're talking to other guys in class...</i>

00:12:40.270 --> 00:12:40.900
<i>Huh?</i>

00:12:41.690 --> 00:12:46.410
Lived in the mountains of Canada

00:12:42.400 --> 00:12:46.410
No school experience until last year

00:12:43.150 --> 00:12:46.410
Doesn't watch TV

00:12:43.900 --> 00:12:46.410
Doesn't play games

00:12:43.970 --> 00:12:46.410
No... It's my fault.

00:12:44.660 --> 00:12:46.410
Only uses the Internet to study

00:12:47.780 --> 00:12:50.910
Sorry I didn't teach you.

00:12:51.590 --> 00:12:53.000
I'll help you.

00:12:53.460 --> 00:12:54.420
Let go!

00:12:54.770 --> 00:12:56.920
H-Haru...

00:12:57.800 --> 00:13:02.970
<i>Somehow, he's so good at 
getting me worked up...</i>

00:13:05.530 --> 00:13:08.740
Ren, come on. You can sleep now, right?

00:13:11.390 --> 00:13:12.280
Haru...

00:13:13.500 --> 00:13:16.370
Um... Sorry for bothering you.

00:13:16.370 --> 00:13:20.770
It's fine. It was my fault for not teaching you.

00:13:20.770 --> 00:13:22.920
It's a real pain.

00:13:22.920 --> 00:13:25.780
You can't call a physiological 
phenomenon a pain.

00:13:26.500 --> 00:13:28.780
Does it happen to you, too, Haru?

00:13:31.610 --> 00:13:33.040
Who knows?

00:13:33.040 --> 00:13:35.800
I'm not as young as you.

00:13:36.430 --> 00:13:40.280
<i>I'm a good-for-nothing adult and a liar.</i>

00:13:47.370 --> 00:13:50.270
You seem to be doing pretty well today.

00:13:50.590 --> 00:13:51.220
Yeah.

00:13:51.510 --> 00:13:54.160
The doctor was right. I was backed up.

00:13:54.890 --> 00:13:56.940
My body feels lighter since I took care of it.

00:14:00.390 --> 00:14:01.440
Are you okay?

00:14:01.840 --> 00:14:03.780
Y-You've heard of domesticated rabbits, right?

00:14:04.210 --> 00:14:07.670
Those aren't babies. They're fully grown adults.

00:14:07.670 --> 00:14:10.020
Even though they're so small.

00:14:10.020 --> 00:14:12.190
Small or not, rabbits are rabbits.

00:14:12.540 --> 00:14:13.790
They taste good roasted.

00:14:13.790 --> 00:14:14.790
You eat them?!

00:14:15.140 --> 00:14:17.380
Wait, that's not what we were talking about!

00:14:17.380 --> 00:14:18.290
What's with you?

00:14:18.740 --> 00:14:22.230
Nothing... Sorry. I was shaken up.

00:14:22.230 --> 00:14:24.800
Please don't talk about your 
lower body while I'm eating.

00:14:25.030 --> 00:14:27.800
Haru said it's normal 
conversation between two men.

00:14:28.200 --> 00:14:30.820
You've got to consider the
time, place, and occasion.

00:14:30.820 --> 00:14:35.300
Besides, you can't blame me for freaking out 
when I hear that coming from your mouth.

00:14:35.300 --> 00:14:37.990
Everyone in class treats you 
like some kind of fairy.

00:14:38.280 --> 00:14:38.810
Huh?

00:14:39.180 --> 00:14:43.820
Never mind. It just means 
you're a healthy young man.

00:14:44.060 --> 00:14:47.190
If that's the case, want to watch a DVD?

00:14:47.570 --> 00:14:49.320
It must be boring without anything to look at.

00:14:49.950 --> 00:14:52.620
Boring? DVD?

00:14:56.570 --> 00:14:57.960
Brother, want some help?

00:14:58.540 --> 00:15:01.030
I'm free until this afternoon 
since my professors are busy.

00:15:01.510 --> 00:15:03.210
Aki said he'd be home late because of work.

00:15:03.630 --> 00:15:07.330
Yeah? The customers like it when you help out.

00:15:07.330 --> 00:15:08.220
I'd appreciate it.

00:15:08.730 --> 00:15:11.700
And it finally stopped raining today,

00:15:11.700 --> 00:15:13.720
so the café has a lot of customers.

00:15:14.180 --> 00:15:15.790
Isn't lunch over?

00:15:16.550 --> 00:15:19.730
There are a lot of young women, 
even though it's not a weekend.

00:15:20.070 --> 00:15:22.650
Maybe it's because of Kiyo's magazine ads.

00:15:22.650 --> 00:15:27.400
A girl in my seminar told me 
she's not into host clubs,

00:15:27.400 --> 00:15:30.020
but she'd like to try visiting 
a café run by a former host.

00:15:30.020 --> 00:15:32.740
That's not even what our selling 
point is supposed to be...

00:15:33.020 --> 00:15:35.360
But I guess nothing beats having more customers.

00:15:36.630 --> 00:15:41.420
By the way, what do you want for dinner? 
I'll make whatever you want.

00:15:41.420 --> 00:15:43.630
Normal dinner is fine with me.

00:15:43.880 --> 00:15:48.340
Make whatever Ren likes. 
He hasn't had much of an appetite lately.

00:15:48.340 --> 00:15:50.380
He seemed to be feeling 
better this morning, though.

00:15:51.760 --> 00:15:53.390
Oh? I'm surprised you noticed.

00:15:53.620 --> 00:15:56.800
My room is right above the bathroom.

00:15:57.220 --> 00:15:58.390
I can hear things quite well.

00:15:59.890 --> 00:16:04.880
By the way, Aki's room is right above 
your bedroom. You should be careful.

00:16:05.310 --> 00:16:07.900
I'm innocent!

00:16:10.000 --> 00:16:11.960
What's wrong with Haru-san?

00:16:11.960 --> 00:16:15.240
He's struggling with questioning 
and defending himself.

00:16:15.240 --> 00:16:16.780
Family matters sure are difficult.

00:16:19.070 --> 00:16:21.160
Shima, where's Haru?

00:16:22.420 --> 00:16:26.000
He just got off work. He's changing in his room.

00:16:26.000 --> 00:16:27.090
Okay.

00:16:27.650 --> 00:16:31.550
Haru, are you there? 
Can I use your computer later?

00:16:33.060 --> 00:16:33.820
Sure.

00:16:35.550 --> 00:16:39.840
My computer's on my desk at the café. 
Need to look something up?

00:16:40.340 --> 00:16:44.560
Uh... No. I wanted to send Haruko an e-mail.

00:16:44.900 --> 00:16:48.070
What's wrong, Ren? Your face is red.

00:16:48.510 --> 00:16:51.460
It's nothing. Hurry up and put on some clothes.

00:16:51.460 --> 00:16:54.940
What? You're the one who walks around naked.

00:16:54.940 --> 00:16:56.070
You're so weird.

00:16:56.320 --> 00:16:59.580
In any case, I'm going to borrow your computer.

00:17:03.870 --> 00:17:06.830
Oh my God! He's too cute!

00:17:07.180 --> 00:17:09.990
Huh? E-mailing Haruko-san?

00:17:10.720 --> 00:17:13.590
He should call her on the phone once in a while.

00:17:16.260 --> 00:17:21.020
<i>I knew I was naïve and 
lacking in common sense,</i>

00:17:21.610 --> 00:17:25.270
<i>but I feel like this is somehow different.</i>

00:17:26.000 --> 00:17:29.190
I should ask Haruko if there's 
something I don't know.

00:17:28.020 --> 00:17:30.270
Effects of imprinting 
as a child

00:17:30.270 --> 00:17:31.780
DVD RW 
Drive 
(F:) Untitled

00:17:32.400 --> 00:17:35.280
There's something in here. A DVD?

00:17:37.590 --> 00:17:39.330
I'll go get Ren.

00:17:39.840 --> 00:17:41.790
Isn't he in his room?

00:17:42.070 --> 00:17:46.480
He's using the store's computer to e-mail—

00:17:49.200 --> 00:17:50.010
Brother?

00:17:50.840 --> 00:17:53.520
<i>I hid the case in the drawer,</i>

00:17:53.520 --> 00:17:56.620
<i>but I'm pretty sure I left the DVD in the...</i>

00:17:57.960 --> 00:17:58.670
Ren!

00:18:00.370 --> 00:18:05.810
Huge mistake!!!

00:18:00.540 --> 00:18:03.780
Ren, that isn't something 
children should watch.

00:18:04.310 --> 00:18:05.810
I'm not a child!

00:18:06.070 --> 00:18:08.060
That's not what I meant.

00:18:08.380 --> 00:18:12.150
So this is the kind of DVD 
Juuzen was talking about.

00:18:12.830 --> 00:18:13.820
How informative.

00:18:14.130 --> 00:18:15.510
Informative?

00:18:15.860 --> 00:18:19.200
Isn't this something most men enjoy watching?

00:18:20.330 --> 00:18:24.080
Of course I should prefer women, but...

00:18:24.540 --> 00:18:28.840
I didn't feel like doing anything 
while watching the woman in the video.

00:18:29.430 --> 00:18:33.090
I kept thinking of your face instead, so...

00:18:34.140 --> 00:18:37.080
There must be something wrong with me

00:18:37.690 --> 00:18:40.090
since I keep thinking about you.

00:18:40.350 --> 00:18:43.600
Yeah, there might be 
something wrong with you.

00:18:44.200 --> 00:18:44.730
Sorry—

00:18:44.730 --> 00:18:46.100
Why are you apologizing?

00:18:46.890 --> 00:18:48.340
It's not your fault!

00:18:48.340 --> 00:18:50.600
But it's weird!

00:18:50.880 --> 00:18:52.620
Why would you assume that?

00:18:52.620 --> 00:18:57.400
I don't like how you always make 
assumptions about things on your own!

00:18:59.580 --> 00:19:00.490
Ren—

00:19:00.780 --> 00:19:03.910
I hate how I am!

00:19:05.130 --> 00:19:09.830
When you tell me you don't like me, 
my chest hurts so much I wish I could die!

00:19:10.230 --> 00:19:14.060
But if that's what you think, 
I know it can't be helped!

00:19:14.060 --> 00:19:15.840
Because there really isn't anything I can do!

00:19:16.420 --> 00:19:19.490
Just like I can't do anything 
about how I love you!

00:19:20.840 --> 00:19:22.850
<i>He really isn't</i>

00:19:28.930 --> 00:19:30.980
<i>just a kid.</i>

00:19:32.490 --> 00:19:35.120
You really are a brat.

00:19:35.610 --> 00:19:37.930
Who taught you to say things like that?

00:19:37.930 --> 00:19:38.610
What are you—

00:19:38.870 --> 00:19:43.620
The real thing is way better than any adult video.

00:19:43.620 --> 00:19:46.350
H-Haru, this is a bad idea.

00:19:46.350 --> 00:19:49.690
I told you there's something 
wrong with me. I'm weird.

00:19:50.140 --> 00:19:50.870
Weird?

00:19:51.260 --> 00:19:54.350
I don't feel anything when I'm with anyone else.

00:19:54.750 --> 00:19:57.200
But when I'm by your side...

00:19:57.200 --> 00:20:01.260
You mean what happened 
last night happens, right?

00:20:01.490 --> 00:20:04.510
It's okay. It's totally normal.

00:20:04.860 --> 00:20:09.770
I'd be sad if that didn't happen, 
even though you love me so much.

00:20:10.890 --> 00:20:11.700
...you?

00:20:13.280 --> 00:20:14.270
What about you?

00:20:15.750 --> 00:20:17.500
You can't tell?

00:20:18.490 --> 00:20:21.430
N-No, I get it...

00:20:23.060 --> 00:20:25.520
<i>Damn, he's too cute.</i>

00:20:25.910 --> 00:20:31.490
<i>If I told him I actually wish I could touch him, 
kiss him, and make a mess of him much more,</i>

00:20:31.490 --> 00:20:34.170
<i>I wonder what kind of face he'd make...</i>

00:20:38.750 --> 00:20:40.030
Hello, Kaidou residence.

00:20:40.780 --> 00:20:42.680
Oh, it's been a while.

00:20:43.090 --> 00:20:45.680
Come on, let me take care of yours.

00:20:46.200 --> 00:20:47.270
What about yours?

00:20:47.580 --> 00:20:50.400
Oh, we don't have time for that.

00:20:51.740 --> 00:20:53.680
Shima's waiting.

00:20:53.680 --> 00:20:56.690
I just came to tell you that dinner's ready.

00:20:56.690 --> 00:20:59.570
Then I'll wait.

00:20:59.570 --> 00:21:03.020
With that expression? It's super obvious.

00:21:03.020 --> 00:21:04.650
What expression?

00:21:04.970 --> 00:21:06.530
That expression.

00:21:06.530 --> 00:21:07.570
Don't lick me!

00:21:08.240 --> 00:21:09.200
Brother, the phone—

00:21:11.280 --> 00:21:12.200
Um...

00:21:12.820 --> 00:21:15.340
<i>I can't explain my way out of this situation!</i>

00:21:13.910 --> 00:21:17.210
Butt hanging out

00:21:17.900 --> 00:21:19.400
It's our lawyer, Kashiwagi.

00:21:20.060 --> 00:21:22.270
I'll tell her you'll call back later.

00:21:22.710 --> 00:21:23.720
Take your time.

00:21:25.330 --> 00:21:26.680
<i>Wait... What?</i>

00:21:27.110 --> 00:21:28.870
<i>Did he just ignore it completely?</i>

00:21:33.130 --> 00:21:35.440
Haru, Haruko's coming to Japan!

00:21:37.330 --> 00:21:39.190
<i>What? Why now?!</i>

00:21:39.550 --> 00:21:41.580
It's been a year since I saw Haruko.

00:21:42.090 --> 00:21:45.110
Ren, you seem really happy.

00:21:45.110 --> 00:21:46.450
Well, it's Haruko!

00:21:46.450 --> 00:21:49.450
Subject:

00:21:47.080 --> 00:21:49.950
<i>I decided to go to Japan to meet you.</i>

00:21:49.950 --> 00:21:51.950
<i>You can fill me in on the details then.</i>

00:21:52.500 --> 00:21:56.080
<i>I feel like my moment of happiness rapidly fled,</i>

00:21:56.080 --> 00:21:59.960
<i>and a demon had announced 
her impending visit.</i>

00:23:29.970 --> 00:23:40.480
Next Time
